  <section class="lp-band lp-band--gold">
    <h2>Why people choose online psychiatric care</h2>
    <h3>No commute</h3>
    <p>You can avoid driving across the Seattle area or rearranging your day around traffic.</p>
    <h3>More flexibility</h3>
    <p>A virtual appointment may be easier to fit around work, school, family responsibilities, or other commitments.</p>
    <h3>Care from your own space</h3>
    <p>You can attend from a private location that feels comfortable to you.</p>
    <h3>Access outside major cities</h3>
    <p>Telehealth can be especially useful for people who live farther from large medical centers or have fewer psychiatric providers nearby.</p>
  </section>

