        <h2>What happens before your appointment?</h2>
        <p><strong>1. Contact the practice</strong><br>Tell us that you are interested in psychiatric care and have Aetna.</p>
        <p><strong>2. Provide your insurance information</strong><br>We can work with the information available to verify benefits and network status.</p>
        <p><strong>3. Complete your intake information</strong><br>You may be asked about your symptoms, history, current medications, previous treatment, and goals.</p>
        <p><strong>4. Prepare your space</strong><br>Find a private location and make sure your camera, microphone, and internet connection are working.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="checklist checklist--gold">
        <li>Contact the Practice</li>
        <li>Provide Your Insurance Information</li>
        <li>Complete Your Intake Information</li>
        <li>Prepare Your Space</li>
